        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>数学解答</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #7a554a;\n      font-family: \"STKaiti\", \"KaiTi\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 430px;\n      padding: 27px 30px 18px 31px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.52;\n    }\n    .top { margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    .formula {\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #754f45;\n      height: 31px;\n    }\n    .content {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .text {\n      width: 300px;\n      padding-top: 2px;\n    }\n    p { margin: 0; }\n    .indent { text-indent: 1.25em; }\n    .line { white-space: nowrap; }\n    .graph {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 294px;\n      top: 57px;\n      width: 205px;\n      height: 157px;\n    }\n    .graph svg {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n      display: block;\n    }\n    .bottom {\n      margin-top: 118px;\n      width: 100%;\n    }\n    .last { margin-top: 3px; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"top\">☆ $F(a)=\\ln a-\\dfrac{a-1}{a+1},\\ F(1)=0$</div>\n    <div class=\"formula\">$F'(a)=\\dfrac{1}{a}-\\dfrac{2}{(a+1)^2}=\\dfrac{a^2+1}{a(a+1)^2}&gt;0$</div>\n\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        <p>• $F(a)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上递增，$a=1$</p>\n        <p>（2）先画图分析：</p>\n        <p>由(1)知，$f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,0)$、$(0,+\\infty)$；</p>\n        <p>$g(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,1)$、$(1,+\\infty)$</p>\n        <p>要有三个交点则必是如右所示，考场中可用零</p>\n        <p>点存在定理证明一下，两函数在 $(0,1)$ 上有一</p>\n        <p>个交点 $x_0$。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"placeholder graph\" aria-label=\"函数图像\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 205 157\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#222\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n            <path d=\"M4 130H199\"/>\n            <path d=\"M104 4V135\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"#222\" font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"10\">\n            <text x=\"201\" y=\"134\">x</text>\n            <text x=\"97\" y=\"10\">y</text>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1\">\n            <path d=\"M12 28 C37 52,57 72,83 97 C96 110,107 111,122 104 C148 89,169 59,194 32\"/>\n            <path d=\"M50 31 C70 50,87 83,102 102 C115 118,133 113,145 86 C151 72,153 49,154 25\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g stroke=\"#444\" stroke-width=\".7\">\n            <path d=\"M86 127V134\"/><path d=\"M113 127V134\"/><path d=\"M144 127V134\"/>\n            <path d=\"M101 105H108\"/><path d=\"M101 111H108\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g fill=\"#222\" font-family=\"serif\" font-size=\"10\">\n            <text x=\"80\" y=\"143\">x₁</text>\n            <text x=\"109\" y=\"143\">x₀</text>\n            <text x=\"140\" y=\"143\">x₂</text>\n            <text x=\"44\" y=\"106\">y = b</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom\">\n      <p>由题知：</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">$g(x_1)=g(x_0)=f(x_0)=f(x_2)$</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{x_0}-x_0=x_1-\\ln x_1=x_2-\\ln x_2\\cdots$</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">$x_1&lt;0&lt;x_0&lt;1&lt;x_2$</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{\\ln x_2}-\\ln x_2=e^{x_2}-\\ln e^{x_1},\\ e^x&gt;1$</p>\n      <p class=\"line\">即 $g(x_1)=g(\\ln x_0),\\ x_1,\\ln x_0&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_1=\\ln x_0$；同理 $f(x_2)=f(e^{x_1})\\Rightarrow x_2=e^{x_1}$</p>\n      <p class=\"last\">$x_1+x_2=\\ln x_0+e^{x_1}=2x_0$，由(＊)式可得。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
